## Usage

Links inside [prose](/api/primitives/prose/) are underlined for you. Anywhere else, give an inline link the `link` identity. It underlines in the text's own color, at the `--decoration-thickness` and `--decoration-offset` tokens, and fades the underline on hover.

```html
<a href="/docs/" data-ui="link">Read the docs</a>
<a href="/terms/" data-ui="link" data-font="sm">Terms</a>
```

Set the color with the `--text` utility, and remove the underline with `--text-decoration: none`. A link that acts like a control is a [button](/api/primitives/button/) with the `link` variant.
